/// @page macro_refs Macro refs
///
/// Explicit link requests to documented macros should resolve even though this page has no file scope: #KEK and #KEK_IN_GROUP.
///
/// Bare prose mentions like KEK should stay plain text, as should unknown names like #KEK_NOT_A_MACRO and code spans like `#KEK`.
///
/// - #KEK inside a list item should also resolve.
///
/// @code{.cpp}
/// int x = KEK;
/// @endcode
